Read CLAUDE.md and the installed Maximus skill. Add authenticated route factories in routes/v1/;
their default export receives the path and returns operations derived from src/application.ts's base.
Declare strict input/output schemas, scope and effect. Use src/ for named domain functions.
Pages return native Responses. Middleware modules default-export an OperationMiddleware<Invocation<Env>>.
Crons export a cron expression and a default scheduled handler; queues and email export native handlers.
Durable Object files default-export their class. Infrastructure declarations remain explicit in
cloudflare.config.ts. Read the Maximus project-structure guide before adding another module kind.
Run bun run verify for non-test validation. Tests require a human request.

Vite+ owns the root toolchain: `vite.config.ts` configures lint/format, `vp check` checks them,
`vp build` bundles the Worker and `vp dev` runs it locally. TypeScript and Cloudflare type generation
remain part of `bun run verify`. Tests are never part of automatic deployment.
